      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2026 年工作计划
  - elementId: tc-desc4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [584, 280, 300, 22]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: '目标任务 · 重点举措 · 保障措施'
  - elementId: tc-line-b
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 352, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {color: "$line"}
  - elementId: tc-sum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 380, 832, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        过去一年，全局上下坚定信心、攻坚克难，
        圆满完成了年度各项目标任务，交出了一份厚实的答卷。
  - elementId: tc-foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 500, 400, 20]
